[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8400.63, "timestamp": "02:20:00", "text": "比如印度的虚拟主播之类的，还有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8402.79, "timestamp": "02:20:02", "text": "我们和那里的很多人一样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8404.79, "timestamp": "02:20:04", "text": "你一直都在指导我，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8407.27, "timestamp": "02:20:07", "text": "甜甜的，一如既往地想帮忙"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8409.19, "timestamp": "02:20:09", "text": "外面有人。我当时就想，我的天哪，那是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8411.51, "timestamp": "02:20:11", "text": "如此甜蜜。我简直无法承受"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8413.59, "timestamp": "02:20:13", "text": "我自己，还有你，都在这里处理这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8415.75, "timestamp": "02:20:15", "text": "你喜欢帮助别人，也乐于助人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8418.15, "timestamp": "02:20:18", "text": "人们努力建立一个社区。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8421.11, "timestamp": "02:20:21", "text": "我一直都很欣赏你这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8423.51, "timestamp": "02:20:23", "text": "嗯，所以，当你出现的时候，我真的非常兴奋。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8425.11, "timestamp": "02:20:25", "text": "就像主动联系你，然后你说，“嘿，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8426.71, "timestamp": "02:20:26", "text": "你想不想，你知道，上来？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8428.15, "timestamp": "02:20:28", "text": "当时我就想，“哦我的天哪，是啊，那会……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8431.429, "timestamp": "02:20:31", "text": "要很棒。”什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8433.59, "timestamp": "02:20:33", "text": "是的。我一直想联系对方，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8436.71, "timestamp": "02:20:36", "text": "你知道，我当时太害羞了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8439.429, "timestamp": "02:20:39", "text": "不，我明白了。我明白了。我有点害羞，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8441.11, "timestamp": "02:20:41", "text": "而且，在主动联系他人方面也是如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8442.55, "timestamp": "02:20:42", "text": "对人们来说。我当时就想，“等等，万一他们……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8444.87, "timestamp": "02:20:44", "text": "拒绝？我的意思是，这不是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8447.03, "timestamp": "02:20:47", "text": "问题，但就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8449.75, "timestamp": "02:20:49", "text": "尴尬。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8451.99, "timestamp": "02:20:51", "text": "我的天哪。但我真的很高兴你这么做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8454.79, "timestamp": "02:20:54", "text": "很高兴我们能一起在这里。耶。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8457.429, "timestamp": "02:20:57", "text": "是的，我很高兴能有机会和你交谈。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8459.91, "timestamp": "02:20:59", "text": "这是你第一次见到我。我只是"}]